<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">建功楼<SPAN lang=EN-US>2-5</SPAN>楼：徐凤碧、张卓燚、王青、陈小燕<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">工作职责：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>）进场铃响前，在相应楼层阻止学生跨越警戒线<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>）学生进场时，在指定楼层协助考生入场工作。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>）负责指定的楼层考场的联络工作。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>）因特殊情况，监考员要离开考场时，顶替监考。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>）学生需上厕所时，陪同监视。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>）上午第一场测试（语文）、下午第一场测试（英语）结束前<SPAN lang=EN-US> 5</SPAN>分钟到考务组领取下一场测试的试卷袋、答题纸袋、草稿纸。语文、英语测试结束后<SPAN lang=EN-US>10</SPAN>分钟内，将下一场测试的试卷袋、答题纸袋送达给各自楼层的相应试场。同时，回收语文、英语测试试卷、答题纸、草稿纸。清点无误后送达考务组。 <SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P> </P>
    
